Settings -> Privacy and Security:
- DNS over HTTPS -> Custom
  - Check 'Always warn me if secure DNS isn't available'
  - Choose provider: Cloudflare (default)
- Connection and software security -> HTTPS-Only Mode -> Enable HTTPS-Only Mode in all windows
- Enhanced Tracking Protection -> Strict
- History -> select 'Customize history' -> uncheck 'remember search and form history'

Settings -> Passwords and autofill:
- Passwords -> Set primary password

Settings -> Permissions and data
- Firefox Data Collection and Use -> uncheck all

Settings -> Tabs and Browsing:
- Recommendations -> Recommend extensions as you browse -> uncheck
- Recommendations -> Recommend features as you browse -> uncheck
- Page navigation -> Enable link previews -> uncheck
- Tabs -> Use AI to suggest tabs and a name for tab groups -> uncheck

Settings -> Home and startup:
- Firefox Home -> Support Firefox -> Sponsored shortcuts -> uncheck
- Startup -> Open previous windows and tabs -> check

Settings -> AI controls:
- On-device AI -> Translations -> Available
                  Image alt text in Firefox PDF viewer -> Blocked
                  Tab group suggestions -> Blocked
                  Key points in link previews -> Blocked
- AI chatbot providers in sidebar -> Chatbot in sidebar -> Blocked

